all_claims:
The simulation method of any of claim 1 to 4, characterized in that said peripheral processing program simulation step further comprises steps of:
 obtaining the number of test instructions required to execute one sequence of a test program; 
 counting the number of executed test instructions; 
 judging whether a predetermined test instruction has been simulated; and 
 simulating said peripheral processing program for the number of clocks counted at said test instruction simulation step in case said predetermined test instruction has been simulated or said number of count reaches the number of test instructions required for executing one sequence of said test program.
